<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Chayce Properties</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Chayce Properties</strong> is a real estate company based in the United Kingdom. Zunkiree Labs works with Chayce as an embedded technical partner rather than a single-project vendor.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The engagement</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Most engagements start with one deliverable &mdash; a website build, an SEO project, a single integration &mdash; and end there. For Chayce Properties, Zunkiree Labs owns the full digital stack: the website itself, the AI systems built on top of it, and the ongoing technical delivery that keeps both running and improving.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">What we manage</h2>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Website</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Ongoing development, maintenance, and improvements to the Chayce Properties website.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">AI systems</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">AI-powered features built into the Chayce Properties platform, designed around how the business actually operates.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Ongoing technical delivery</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Continuous delivery of fixes, features, and technical work &mdash; not a one-time handoff.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Why it works</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Owning the whole stack means Zunkiree Labs doesn't have to hand off between vendors when a website change affects an AI feature, or when an AI feature needs a change on the site. One team, one point of accountability, across every system Chayce Properties runs on.
  </p>
</div>

